<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπάνωθεν</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπάντλ-ωθε</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>above, on top,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούφα σοι χθὼν ἐπάνωθε πέσοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					463
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				45a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>up country, inland,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of Time,
				<i>of old,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαῶν τῶν ἐ.</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐπάνωθε μουσοποιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					22.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς ἐ.</span> in <i>former
				times</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPR</u>
				188.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
